            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_c7000",
              "x": 208,
              "y": 28,
              "name": "窗口标题",
              "fill": "#E7B85B",
              "effect": {
                "type": "shadow",
                "shadowType": "outer",
                "color": "#1A120A99",
                "offset": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 2
                },
                "blur": 2
              },
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 300,
              "content": "轮回进阶系统",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_c8000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 206,
              "name": "介绍标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "轮回进阶系统是什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_c9000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "介绍正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "轮回进阶系统负责把每轮胜利后的奖励变成长期成长。\n它只做两条链路：轮回装备解锁、轮回特质解锁。\n世界档位、王国档位、随机属性和发放日志都会写入存档。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_cb000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 405,
              "name": "流程标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "结算时怎么发放",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_cc000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 451,
              "name": "流程正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "1. 先计算当前世界档位，并截断到阶位上限。\n2. 再按王国档位模式，计算每个王国的生效档位。\n3. 按“装备解锁 → 特质解锁”的顺序发放。\n4. 魔王势力固定按当前世界档位过滤奖励。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_ce000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 632,
              "name": "系统入口标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "玩家重点看什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "adv_cf000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 678,
              "name": "系统入口正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "看档位：决定这轮能开到什么强度。\n看王国档位：决定普通王国能拿到多少长期成长。\n看随机池：决定装备和特质实例会抽到哪些属性。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "adv_cg000",
